.TH tucrc n 0.1 tclutils
.SH tclutils::tucrc
.PP
Checksum helpers using Tcl core \fBzlib\fR.
.SS API
.CS
set crc [::tclutils::tucrc::crc32 $bytes]
puts [::tclutils::tucrc::hex32 $crc]
.CE
.PP
Commands:
.IP \(bu
\fBcrc32 data ?initValue?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBadler32 data ?initValue?\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBcrc32File path\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBadler32File path\fR
.IP \(bu
\fBhex32 value\fR
